  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands Nigeria Clean Tech Event in Abuja 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The plan was to organize the Netherlands Nigeria Clean Tech Event in Abuja on November 1, 2022. Unfortunately, the event had to be postponed, because of safety issues.On June 7, 2023 CERF had the opportunity to organize this event in Abuja. This was a joint event to showcase the opportunities of climate mitigation in Nigeria for government to government cooperation, enterpreneurs, for jobs and for access to energy.There was lots of enthusiasm for the event, around 200 people participated. The timing of the event was good, because the new government had not yet been formed. Therefore, it was the right time to position climate mitigation as an important topic. Besides opportunities, there was also discussion about challenges and how to scale good practices and innovations.The event had a lot of positive PR in news papers and on social media.</narrative>
  </description>
